{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:816a4a0294fd4788","name":"Herdr'tui","source":{"id":"source:reference-816a4a0294fd4788","title":"Herdr'tui","revision":21611,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:08:27Z","sha256":"c255799ca900819e2255eb0b42e590856bbb1c35f0edfc91f51493242074e32b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21611","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Herdr%27tui&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-816a4a0294fd4788","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sword of the Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sword_of_the_Empire","referenceId":"reference:56baf6e19ed21c48"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Herdr'tui, as he calls himself, is a member of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stereb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stereb","referenceId":"reference:ba0059137d05cad7"}," Species, an interstellar race of cave dwellers whose presence on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"}," has been, until now, unknown to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". His Basic vocabulary is very limited; there's no telling where he picked it up, but ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stereb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stereb","referenceId":"reference:ba0059137d05cad7"}," are great mimics. He's been lost in Prak City for several days, and he seems to have come from below. Imperial drilling on the plateau attracted his attention, as a few inquiries reveal:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Where did you come from?"]}," \"From ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"},". From inside, where the vital air and fluids nourish the Worldflesh.\""]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["How did you get stuck here?"]}," \"I saw the holes where the parasites were fouling our caverns with their filth. I followed the hidden waters' flow upward and found a passage to this place. But ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"}," was weak, and the footing crumbled.\""]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["How long have you been up here in Prak City?"]}," \"Since I arrived.\""]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Why do you trust us?"]}," \"I saw you help the green man against the people who chased me. You are not of them. Perhaps you are of the stone.\""]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Is there another way to your home?"]}," \"The pits they have drilled reach there. But I know what awaits below now. I fear to go alone. But with ",{"tag":"i","children":["you"]},", perhaps...\""]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Why are you hiding here?"]}," \"I want to go home, to return before it is too late. You cannot leave them untended. You will help me reach what I hear them call the Drains.\""]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If asked what cannot be left unattended or what waits for him below, Herdr'tui will mention a single word: ",{"tag":"i","children":["greethka"]},". But he cannot translate it into any word the heroes understand.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Herdr'tui Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stereb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stereb","referenceId":"reference:ba0059137d05cad7"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6/",